"""WorkflowBar: مراحل القيد (مسودة ← مراجعة ← اعتماد ← ترحيل) + الإجراءات المتاحة للمستخدم الحالي فقط، بسبب تعطيل في التلميح.

الحساب كله في core/workflow.py (خالص ومختبَر ومطابق للمحرك). هنا عرض فقط. يتطلب PySide6.
"""
from PySide6.QtCore import Qt, Signal
from PySide6.QtWidgets import QFrame, QHBoxLayout, QLabel, QPushButton, QWidget

from alhisabat.ui.core import workflow as W
from alhisabat.ui.design import icons, tokens as T

from .basic import StatusBadge, repolish


class StageChip(QLabel):
    def __init__(self, text, parent=None):
        super().__init__(text, parent)
        self.setAlignment(Qt.AlignCenter)
        self.setProperty('badge', True)
        self.setMinimumWidth(70)

    def set_state(self, state):          # done | current | todo
        self.setProperty('tone', {'done': 'success', 'current': 'info', 'todo': 'neutral'}[state])
        f = self.font()
        f.setBold(state == 'current')
        self.setFont(f)
        repolish(self)


class WorkflowBar(QFrame):
    actionTriggered = Signal(str)        # مفتاح الإجراء (review/approve/post/reverse/...)

    def __init__(self, access, user_id, parent=None):
        super().__init__(parent)
        self.setObjectName('panel')
        self.access, self.user_id = access, user_id
        self._lay = QHBoxLayout(self)
        self._lay.setContentsMargins(8, 4, 8, 4)
        self.setLayoutDirection(Qt.RightToLeft)
        self._stage_chips = {}
        for st in W.STAGES:
            chip = StageChip(W.STAGE_LABELS[st])
            self._stage_chips[st] = chip
            self._lay.addWidget(chip)
            if st != W.STAGES[-1]:
                arrow = QLabel('←')
                arrow.setObjectName('ctxKey')
                self._lay.addWidget(arrow)
        self.badge = StatusBadge()
        self._lay.addSpacing(12)
        self._lay.addWidget(self.badge)
        self._lay.addStretch(1)
        self._btns = []
        self._entry, self._settings, self._ro = None, W.WorkflowSettings(), ''

    def set_entry(self, entry, settings, read_only_reason='', mode='light'):
        """entry: dict (status, workflow_state, entry_type, created_by). None ← يفرغ الشريط."""
        self._entry, self._settings, self._ro = entry, settings, read_only_reason
        for b in self._btns:
            self._lay.removeWidget(b)
            b.deleteLater()
        self._btns = []
        if not entry:
            for chip in self._stage_chips.values():
                chip.set_state('todo')
            return
        cur = W.stage_of(entry)
        order = list(W.STAGES)
        for st, chip in self._stage_chips.items():
            chip.set_state('current' if st == cur else ('done' if order.index(st) < order.index(cur) else 'todo'))
        self.badge.set_status(entry.get('status'), entry.get('workflow_state'))
        pal = T.palette(mode)
        for a in W.journal_actions(entry, settings, self.access, self.user_id, read_only_reason):
            b = QPushButton(a.label)
            b.setIcon(icons.qicon(a.icon, pal['text']))
            b.setEnabled(a.enabled)
            b.setToolTip(a.reason if not a.enabled else a.label)
            if a.primary:
                b.setProperty('primary', True)
            if a.danger:
                b.setProperty('danger', True)
            b.clicked.connect(lambda _c=False, k=a.key: self.actionTriggered.emit(k))
            self._lay.addWidget(b)
            self._btns.append(b)
